# What the release job installs. `build` makes the sdist and the wheel and
# `twine` checks them before they are published.
#
# release.txt is compiled from this file and is what the workflow installs.
# Dependabot watches this directory and bumps the compiled file. A version
# written inside a `run:` line is invisible to it, which is why the pin lives
# here.
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --no-header \
#     --output-file=.github/requirements/release.txt .github/requirements/release.in
build
twine
